   "fix": "Weaken to `(hexp : \u2203 a : \u211d, 0 < a \u2227 Integrable (fun x => Real.exp (a * |x|) * g x) \u03bd)`, matching the engine's convention. Integrability of g follows since exp(a|x|) \u2265 1; the polynomial-moment bound uses `|x|^n \u2264 (n!/a^n)\u00b7exp(a|x|)`. Any caller holding the \u2200-a bound supplies the existential via a=1, so nothing downstream is lost.",
